Description: Add a regression test for the plugin model toggle
 The KDE Connect app writes the per-device plugin configuration and now
 calls Device::setPluginEnabled() so kdeconnectd reloads the plugin map.
 Add a test that drives PluginModel::setData() and verifies the daemon sees
 the new state immediately. The test daemon registers the KDE Connect D-Bus
 service name so DeviceDbusInterface resolves the loopback device.
